@he-yufeng I've opened the follow-up as draft #60796. The new input-queue regression is isolated in [ac38173](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60796/commits/ac381735e545560903f578bb3bb469d5c3a1492f), covering both synchronous and asynchronous scheduling. Both variants passed the GPU validation reported above.

It is based on `84d4578`, so the comparison currently includes this PR's two commits. I'll move the test commit onto the updated `main` and rerun validation after this PR merges.

I'd appreciate your review of the test when you have a chance. Thanks again for offering to take a look!

